# .NET
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user
*.suo

# The user's GLOBAL gitignore (~/.gitignore, a Unity template) ignores *.csproj and *.sln.
# Re-include our C# project files so the build definition is actually tracked. We use .slnx,
# which the global *.sln pattern does not match, so the solution needs no negation.
!*.csproj

